# Postman
# Rooted, so this matches a top-level `postman/` scratch directory and NOT
# `docs/postman/`, which holds the generated collection that
# tests/auth/openapi.drift.spec.ts reads. An unrooted pattern matched both, so a
# fresh clone had no collection and the drift spec threw at collection time.
/postman/
.postman/

